I'm a software developer from Belfast, currently living in the US of A
:statue_of_liberty:.

This website serves as a portfolio of my projects, and a place to post content
I find interesting or useful. It was generated using a custom
[static site generator][] hosted on GitHub pages. A complete archive of this
site is available for download [here][].

I can be reached via email at `contact [at] wasteofcyberspace.net` or on GitHub
